OL,3,GNEWSAOrder to tackle dog fouling in
OL,4,AFenland extended
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn order aimed at tackling dog fouling
OL,7,Fand keeping dogs on leads in certain
OL,8,Fareas has been extended across Fenland
OL,9,Ffor a further three years.
OL,11,FFenland District Council's cabinet
OL,12,Fagreed on Monday to extend a Dog
OL,13,FControl Public Spaces Protection Order.
OL,15,FThe order requires owners to clean up
OL,16,Fafter dogs in all open spaces and
OL,17,Fstreets immediately, keep dogs on a
OL,18,Flead in certain areas including
OL,19,Fchildren's play areas - and if directed
OL,20,Fto do so by an authorised officer.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
